# copy ships with the scaffold and is refreshed on every scaffold release
# so the WS-003 §2 security gate has a local GREEN path out of the box.
#
# How it is used (WS-003 §2, check 1): for an Expansion with `author: myICOR`,
# compute sha256 of the bytes of its `expansion.yaml` and look for a matching
# `<slug>@<version>` line below.
#   Match          -> GREEN (auto-trust, calm announcement).
#   Mismatch       -> RED (refuse the install).
#   No entry found -> YELLOW (version not pinned yet — explicit user override
#                     required, or check the myICOR Expansion Packs page for a
#                     freshly published hash).
#
# Format (one entry per line):
#   <slug>@<version> sha256=<hex>
#
# Hash is sha256 of the bytes of expansion.yaml only.
#
# DO NOT hand-edit or append entries here. Community Expansions never go in
# this file — they go through the tier-3 trust prompt. New official pins
# arrive with scaffold updates (this file is on the updater's framework
# allow-list).

